@startuml UC-67 Unpublish Hub Content - Sequence Diagram (stereo)
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI"
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #000000
skinparam DatabaseBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam DatabaseBorderColor #000000
skinparam ArrowColor #000000
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam maxMessageSize 280

actor Teacher
participant ":LibraryScreen" as UI <<user interaction>>
participant ":LibraryContentController" as CTL <<coordinator>>
participant ":LibraryContentService" as SVC <<business logic>>
participant ":LibraryContentRepository" as CONTENTS <<interface>>
database DB

autonumber
activate Teacher
Teacher ->> UI : Click "Withdraw from the review queue" on an owned item that is Pending Publish
activate UI
UI ->> UI : requestAction(content, kind)
UI -->> Teacher : Show the confirmation popup with the item title

opt teacher cancels the withdrawal
  Teacher ->> UI : Click "Cancel"
  UI -->> Teacher : Close the popup and keep the item Pending Publish in the Hub moderation queue
end

Teacher ->> UI : Click "Withdraw" to confirm
UI ->> UI : performAction()
UI ->> CTL : DELETE /api/library/contents/{id}/submission
activate CTL
CTL ->> SVC : unsubmit(id)
activate SVC
SVC ->> CONTENTS : findActiveById(id)
activate CONTENTS
CONTENTS ->> DB : SELECT * FROM library_contents WHERE id = ? AND deleted_at IS NULL
activate DB
DB -->> CONTENTS : row / none
deactivate DB
CONTENTS -->> SVC : LibraryContent
deactivate CONTENTS
SVC ->> SVC : check that the item is owned by the teacher and still has Publish Status SUBMITTED

alt the item is unavailable, not owned or no longer Pending Publish
  SVC -->> CTL : ResourceNotFoundException / ForbiddenOperationException / StateConflictException
  CTL -->> UI : HTTP 404 / HTTP 403 / HTTP 409
  UI -->> Teacher : Show that only a pending publication request can be withdrawn and change nothing stored
else the item is owned and still Pending Publish
  SVC ->> CONTENTS : save(content with status PRIVATE and submittedAt cleared)
  activate CONTENTS
  CONTENTS ->> DB : UPDATE library_contents SET status = 'PRIVATE', submitted_at = NULL, updated_at = ? WHERE id = ?
  activate DB
  DB -->> CONTENTS : Saved
  deactivate DB
  CONTENTS -->> SVC : LibraryContent
  deactivate CONTENTS
  SVC -->> CTL : Detail
  CTL -->> UI : HTTP 200 + Detail
  UI ->> UI : load()
  UI -->> Teacher : Show MSG21 and the updated Publish Status Draft, editable again outside the Hub queue
end
deactivate SVC
deactivate CTL
deactivate UI
deactivate Teacher
@enduml
